# The Cloning of Shredder ({4}{B}{B} Saga). I: Bot1 exiles Rat King, Verminister (a legendary Rat Avatar) from its graveyard and
# creates a token copy of it that isn't legendary and is a Mutant in addition (CR 707.9b). II and III each copy a card exiled
# with the Saga (CR 607.2a) - the same card, still in exile - so Bot1 ends with three Rat King tokens and the card in exile. Legendary copies would die to the legend rule (CR 704.5j), so three of them standing shows each is not; the Saga is sacrificed after III (CR 714.4). The Rat Token is Rat King's own disappear trigger on the Lotus.

